    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n7016" root="حبو" body-key="H">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حِبَآءٌ</span></b>  (S, Mgh, K) a subst. from <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَبَاهُ</span> “ he gave
him without any compensation ” &amp;c., (K,) as also
↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حُبْوَةٌ</span></b>  (Msb, K) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَبْوَةٌ</span></b>  and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حِبْوَةٌ</span></b> ; (K;)
all held by Lh to be inf. ns.: (TA:) or meaning
<i>A gift.</i> (S, Mgh.) And the first, The <i>dowry of
a woman</i> or <i>wife.</i> (TA.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حُبْوَةٌ</span>, in
two places.

